  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## 2.0.1\n### Fixes\n- Issue 1, Resolved, Fixed Property Metadata From Overwriting itself and prioritized derived class over base.\n- Fixed MerlinException not mapping error messages correctly.\n- Addressed all compiler warnings, \n### Added\n- Documentation for all public api's\n- Added GetFriendlyName Extension for Type to resolve nullable types cleanly Ie. int? instead of Nullable`1\n- Replaced all refernces to Type.Name to Type.GetFriendlyName()\n\n## 2.0.0\n\nMerlin 2.0 is a major architectural update focused on consistency, diagnostics, and maintainability.\n\n### Added\n- Structured exception framework with module-specific error codes.\n- Resource-based error messaging.\n- Improved mapping and conversion diagnostics.\n- Enhanced support for identifying and troubleshooting runtime failures.\n\n### Changed\n- Refactored internal architecture.\n- Updated exception handling behavior.\n- Improved consistency across Merlin components.\n\n### Breaking Changes\n- Existing consumers using previous exception types or behaviors may require updates.",
